  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. FORWARD BIAS (Red -> P, Black -> N)\n   - Barrier lowers: q(V0 - V)\n   - Depletion width W NARROWS\n   - Exponential current once V >= 0.70 V (LED ON)\n\n2. REVERSE BIAS (Red -> N, Black -> P)\n   - Barrier increases: q(V0 + V_rev)\n   - Depletion width W WIDENS; only Is (~2.5 nA) leaks\n\n3. BREAKDOWN & SERIES RESISTOR (220 ohm)\n   - Above -50 V avalanche current surges!\n   - Without R, diode burns out (thermal runaway).\n   - Press RESET STATION after testing Breakdown."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 681ca1b6889b2d74aacd8f32fcf4359e, type: 2}
